  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 420.04 Form PA-35, “Municipal Assessing Officials’ Response to Tax Credits/Exemptions or Tax Deferral Application.” The municipal assessing officials shall:\n\n(a) Send Form PA-35 to the applicant on or before July 1:\n\n(1) Prior to the date of notice of tax if the applicant timely completed and filed Form PA-29; or\n\n(2) Following the date of notice of tax if the applicant timely completed and filed Form PA-30; and\n\n(b) On Form PA-35:\n\n(1) Notify the applicant of the municipal assessing officials’ decision; and\n\n(2) Notify the applicant of the applicant’s appeal rights.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 419.04)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev400.html"
